WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.850
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:08.020
CARMEN WYATT-HAYES:
I like old stuff.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.290
And what I love
about Hillsdale is

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:12.790
that I can teach the classics.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.810
I am a bicultural,
bilingual human being.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.230
And I guess something
very important to me

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.840
is to have people
understand one another.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.820
And I think that is
one of the reasons I

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:34.950
love to teach Spanish,
to understand a culture,

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.080
how it is similar
to ours, and how

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:43.480
it is different, not only across
cultures, but across time.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.340
And I get to do
that at Hillsdale.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.850
I get to explain through
the classic texts

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.360
across time, across
cultures, how

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.150
a perspective might be different
and to bring understanding.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.200
[MUSIC PLAYING]

